ision_id": "f55ac6f7-8cb0-4b8b-abed-67f4237b911f", "resource_type": null}, {"resource_group": "Capag Exercicios Anteriores", "cache_last_updated": null, "package_id": "9ff93162-409e-48b5-91d9-cf645a47fdfc", "webstore_last_updated": null, "id": "86636c19-b38a-4b9e-8fff-30fc4208dd04", "size": "554012", "state": "active", "hash": "", "description": "CAPAG dos Munic\u00edpios 2022. Ano Base 2021", "format": "XLSX", "mimetype_inner": null, "url_type": "upload", "mimetype": null, "cache_url": null, "name": "CAPAG Munic\u00edpios 2022 ", "created": "2022-06-20T16:16:50.501291", "url": "https://www.tesourotransparente.gov.br/ckan/dataset/9ff93162-409e-48b5-91d9-cf645a47fdfc/resource/86636c19-b38a-4b9e-8fff-30fc4208dd04/download/capag-municipios-2022.xlsx", "webstore_url": null, "last_modified": "2024-08-14T00:53:33.521831", "position": 4, "revision_id": "f55ac6f7-8cb0-4b8b-abed-67f4237b911f", "resource_type": null}, {"resource_group": "Capag Exercicios Anteriores", "cache_last_updated": null, "package_id": "9ff93162-409e-48b5-91d9-cf645a47fdfc", "webstore_last_updated": null, "id": "6a218451-f1b4-4fce-ac2a-00a3675bf4eb", "size": "813017", "state": "active", "hash": "", "description": "Substitui o arquivo postado em 17 de mar\u00e7o com dados mais atualizados e corre\u00e7\u00e3o de erro detectado no indicador II usado para a revis\u00e3o da capag. H\u00e1 dados com ano base 2022, para entes que j\u00e1 tinham publicado a DCA na data do levantamento, ou de ano base 2021, para os demais entes.", "format": "XLSX", "mimetype_inner": null, "url_type": "upload", "mimetype": null, "cache_url": null, "name": "Capag Munic\u00edpios 2022 - revis\u00e3o", "created": "2023-02-20T11:29:42.691208", "url": "https://www.tesourotransparente.gov.br/ckan/dataset/9ff93162-409e-48b5-91d9-cf645a47fdfc/resource/6a218451-f1b4-4fce-ac2a-00a3675bf4eb/download/capag-oficial-municipios-2023-02-23-corrigido.xlsx", "webstore_url": null, "last_modified": "2024-08-13T21:53:01.310027", "position": 5, "revision_id": "f55ac6f7-8cb0-4b8b-abed-67f4237b911f", "resource_type": null}, {"resource_group": "Capag Exercicios Anteriores", "cache_last_updated": null, "package_id": "9ff93162-409e-48b5-91d9-cf645a47fdfc", "webstore_last_updated": null, "id": "31ed778a-9115-419c-b18e-c9131a978aef", "size": "548251", "state": "active", "hash": "", "description": "NOTA: Ajuste nos crit\u00e9rios de c\u00e1lculo. \r\n\r\nNeste dataset temos a capag 23 calculada com dados ano base 2022. A partir desta publica\u00e7\u00e3o, passamos a n\u00e3o mais calcular a capag para os munic\u00edpios que se encontram em uma ou mais destas condi\u00e7\u00f5es:\r\n\r\n- N\u00e3o homologou a DCA 2022 no Siconfi at\u00e9 o momento de gera\u00e7\u00e3o da base (19/06/2023) de dados que usamos pra gera\u00e7\u00e3o deste dataset.\r\n\r\n- Informou no RGF do 3\u00b0 quadrimestre / 2\u00ba semestre do \u00faltimo exerc\u00edcio valor negativo para a combina\u00e7\u00e3o de Conta = \"TOTAL DOS RECURSOS VINCULADOS (I)\" e Colunas = \"b\" a \"e\".\r\n\r\n- Informou no RGF do 3\u00b0 quadrimestre / 2\u00ba semestre do \u00faltimo exerc\u00edcio valor negativo ou igual a zero na combina\u00e7\u00e3o de Conta = TOTAL DOS RECURSOS VINCULADOS (I) e Coluna \"a\". \r\n\r\n- Informou em pelo menos uma das DCAs dos \u00faltimos 3 exerc\u00edcios valor negativo para a combina\u00e7\u00e3o de Conta = \"1.0.0.0.00.0.0 - Receitas Correntes\" ou \"7.0.0.00.0.0 - Receitas Correntes\" e Colunas = \"Dedu\u00e7\u00f5es - FUNDEB\" ou \"Outras Dedu\u00e7\u00f5es de Receita ou \"Dedu\u00e7\u00f5es - Transfer\u00eancias Constitucionais\".\r\n\r\nEstas modifica\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o alinhadas com as altera\u00e7\u00f5es que foram implementadas no c\u00e1lculo que \u00e9 apresentado na Pr\u00e9via Fiscal. Contudo, ao contr\u00e1rio do dado que \u00e9 apresentado l\u00e1,  atualizado diariamente com base no dados homologados no siconfi at\u00e9 o dia anterior, a nota calculada aqui tem por base os dados do finbra dispon\u00edveis no dia 19/06/2023 e n\u00e3o refletem homologa\u00e7\u00f5es feitas ap\u00f3s esta data. ", "format": "XLSX", "mimetype_inner": null, "url_type": "upload", "mimetype": null, "cache_url": null, "name": "CAPAG Munic\u00edpios 2023", "created": "2023-06-18T04:55:05.928247", "url": "https://www.tesourotransparente.gov.br/ckan/dataset/9ff93162-409e-48b5-91d9-cf645a47fdfc/resource/31ed778a-9115-419c-b18e-c9131a978aef/download/capag-municipios-2023.xlsx", "webstore_url": null, "last_modified": "2024-08-12T18:20:09.655067", "position": 6, "revision_id": "f55ac6f7-8cb0-4b8b-abed-67f4237b911f", "resource_type": null}, {"resource_group": "Capag Exercicios Anteriores", "cache_last_updated": null, "package_id": "9ff93162-409e-48b5-91d9-cf645a47fdfc", "webstore_last_updated": null, "id": "dd42ca38-0427-45e6-8007-b39bd79ba51f", "size": "21134206", "state": "active", "hash": "", "description": "Ano Base 2023. Refer\u00eancia Siconfi: 14/05/2024; Ranking da Qualidade da Informa\u00e7\u00e3o: 31/01/2024; ", "format": "XLSX", "mimetype_inner": null, "url_type": "upload", "mimetype": null, "cache_url": null, "name": "CAPAG Munic\u00edpios 2024 - 14/05/2024", "created": "2024-06-18T12:08:48.315094", "url": "https://www.tesourotransparente.gov.br/ckan/dataset/9ff93162-409e-48b5-91d9-cf645a47fdfc/resource/dd42ca38-0427-45e6-8007-b39bd79ba51f/download/tt20240515capag-municipios.xlsx", "webstore_url": null, "last_modified": "2025-06-11T14:41:04.811415", "position": 7, "revision_id": "31427af3-be94-4260-b4d9-411837561811", "resource_type": null}, {"resource_group": "Capag Exercicios Anteriores", "cache_last_updated": null, "package_id": "9ff93162-409e-48b5-91d9-cf645a47fdfc", "webstore_last_updated": null, "id": "aaab7fd4-6c09-4f0e-8a30-545503c56b59", "size": "21266783", "state": "active", "hash": "", "description": "Ano Base 2023. Refer\u00eancia Siconfi: 02/06/2024; Ranking da Qualidade da Informa\u00e7\u00e3o: 31/05/2024.", "format": "XLSX", "mimetype_inner": null, "url_type": "upload", "m